Recommends: nftables
Description: web panel to manage frp (frps and frpc)
 FRP Manager drives frps and frpc from the browser: instances and live logs,
 tunnels and ports, an nftables firewall for frps, accounts with permissions,
 OpenID Connect single sign-on, webhook notifications and verified frp updates.
 A single static program, with no runtime dependency.
